Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?phlink:=20phase=205-07=20=E2=80=94=20pin=20comp?=
 =?UTF-8?q?onent-updater=20to=20updates.phlink.invalid?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Per PRD §10.1 / D-05, phlink does not contact Google's component-updater
servers and has no opt-in telemetry. Until phase 11 stands up the real
TUF-style update service, point both kUpdaterJSONDefaultUrl and
kUpdaterJSONFallbackUrl at a non-resolving sentinel host
(`https://updates.phlink.invalid/`) so that any component-updater
traffic fails closed.

Effects:
- chrome://components still enumerates components (the registry is
  populated locally), but every check-for-update request DNS-fails and
  is silently ignored.
- No update.googleapis.com contact at any layer.
- No new UMA / no error toast surfaces (handled by existing silent-
  failure paths in the updater).

Refs PRD §10.1 (D-05), plan 5-07.
---
 .../component_updater_url_constants.cc                 | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/component_updater/component_updater_url_constants.cc b/components/component_updater/component_updater_url_constants.cc
index 95c0d48942654..f8ceea05a38fe 100644
--- a/components/component_updater/component_updater_url_constants.cc
+++ b/components/component_updater/component_updater_url_constants.cc
@@ -14,10 +14,16 @@ namespace component_updater {
 //
 // The value of |kDefaultUrlSource| can be overridden with
 // --component-updater=url-source=someurl.
+// phlink (PRD §10.1, D-05): the component updater is pinned to a phlink
+// endpoint we control. Until phase 11 stands up the real TUF-style updater
+// service, both URLs point at a non-resolving sentinel host so that any
+// component-updater traffic fails closed (no Google contact, no UMA, no
+// "phone home"). The default Chromium endpoints are intentionally not
+// shipped.
 const char kUpdaterJSONDefaultUrl[] =
-    "https://update.googleapis.com/service/update2/json";
+    "https://updates.phlink.invalid/service/update2/json";
 
 const char kUpdaterJSONFallbackUrl[] =
-    "http://update.googleapis.com/service/update2/json";
+    "https://updates.phlink.invalid/service/update2/json";
 
 }  // namespace component_updater
